WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 5.7 · Internal Systems & Operations
Compliance essentials from day one

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Protect people before your first activity, in proportion to what you actually do.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Start with conduct, safeguarding, data, consent and conflicts.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Add the safety rules your activities need.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Keep each one short and known to everyone.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Tide Line Youth Collective (Community group · idea stage, Indonesia)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Code of conduct, Sari as safeguarding focal person, parental consent, two adults always present, life jackets for the boat.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You write the essentials you need now, with owners and dates.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
